WEBVTT

00:19:28.329 --> 00:19:31.329
very clear on on their sense of purpose.

00:19:33.163 --> 00:19:37.871
The method Priya put me through years ago
that made a huge difference in my life

00:19:37.871 --> 00:19:41.246
and work. I'm going to get you to
do it to a little bit different.

00:19:41.913 --> 00:19:44.704
If you know someone who you think should
join our little experiment,

00:19:44.704 --> 00:19:46.121
please tell them about the show.

00:19:46.538 --> 00:19:50.913
If you'd like to do this process with
extra added information and links to all

00:19:50.913 --> 00:19:52.913
the stuff I mentioned in the
episode plus articles.

00:19:52.913 --> 00:19:55.121
I think you might like reading
while you go through this.

00:19:55.538 --> 00:19:59.204
Please sign up for the newsletter.
It's at Zig-Zag Pod Dotcom.

00:19:59.996 --> 00:20:04.996
You can always find me at my other job as
host of NPR's TED Radio Hour. Oh yeah.